{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o108a","title":"孙权围合肥新城陆逊诸葛瑾屯江夏沔口孙韶张承向广陵淮阴","accounts":[{"id":"wuzhu-e-o108a-account","label":"《吴主传第二》正文","text":"孙权围合肥新城陆逊诸葛瑾屯江夏沔口孙韶张承向广陵淮阴","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o108a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"围城","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o108a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0115","role":"出军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o108a-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0002","role":"出军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o108a-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0037","role":"出军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o108a-q"]},{"person":"zhouyu-p0035","role":"出军","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o108a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":234,"label":"夏五月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wuzhu-y234","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wuzhu-q-o107","basis":"夏五月"},"evidence":["wuzhu-e-o108a-q","wuzhu-q-o107","zhuge-q-o039","zhuge-q-b-934abed655148ea08df3"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuzhu-e-o108a-q","source_order":[47,559,"O108a"],"related_events":[{"event":"mingdi-e-o039b","type":"related","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o108a-q","mingdi-e-o039b-q"]}],"order":8319},{"id":"mingdi-e-o039b","title":"孙权攻合肥新城遣陆议孙韶攻淮沔","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o039b-account","label":"《明帝纪》正文","text":"孙权攻合肥新城遣陆议孙韶攻淮沔","evidence":["mingdi-e-o039b-q"]},{"id":"mantian-a-5b240f4b9ce45afa8920","label":"正文","text":"宠烧攻具射杀孙泰权引退","evidence":["mantian-q-68662ceb5338803231ef"]},{"id":"mantian-a-192cb9a92a82d4c4d18f","label":"正文","text":"权自将号十万，至合肥新城","evidence":["mantian-q-600ebe2871292deea210"]},{"id":"mantian-a-e52c1a0a8f728ecdc6cf","label":"正文","text":"豫上状听贼攻城挫锐贼遁走","evidence":["mantian-q-3c5cf736a6778f82e410"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-9c9e88ad3c63b2683f44","label":"正文","text":"泰嘉禾三年，从权围新城，中流矢死","evidence":["zongshi-q-5332e816b24f3e1694a6"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-e9dec7ebfa38cd03f65c","label":"正文","text":"嘉禾三年，权与蜀克期大举；权自向新城，然与全琮各受斧钺，为左、右督","evidence":["zhulv-q-c6662a503490f6f162ea"]},{"id":"zhulv-a-c15f0e0fe64f6b8cb30f","label":"正文","text":"会吏士疾病，故未攻而退","evidence":["zhulv-q-d391e3b5a74a420c1faa"]}],"participants":[{"person":"sun-quan","role":"出军","evidence":["mingdi-e-o039b-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0115","role":"奉命出军","evidence":["mingdi-e-o039b-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0037","role":"奉命出军","evidence":["mingdi-e-o039b-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0038","role":"驰往赴、募壮士数十人、折松为炬灌以麻油、从上风放火烧贼攻具、射杀权弟子孙泰","evidence":["mantian-q-68662ceb5338803231ef","mantian-q-3c5cf736a6778f82e410"]},{"person":"mantian-p0008","role":"权弟子、被射杀","evidence":["mantian-q-68662ceb5338803231ef"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0025","role":"曰贼悉众大举非徒投射小利、欲质新城以致大军耳、宜听使攻城挫其锐气不当与争锋、疲怠然后击之可大克、若贼见计必不攻城势将自走、大军相向当使难知不当使自画、辄上状","evidence":["mantian-q-3c5cf736a6778f82e410"]},{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"从之","evidence":["mantian-q-3c5cf736a6778f82e410"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0046","role":"受钺为督者；未攻而退者","evidence":["zhulv-q-c6662a503490f6f162ea","zhulv-q-d391e3b5a74a420c1faa"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0005","role":"受钺为督者","evidence":["zhulv-q-c6662a503490f6f162ea"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":234,"label":"五月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y234","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o037","basis":"五月"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-o039b-q","mingdi-q-o037","mingdi-q-b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-o039b-q","source_order":[3,269,"O039b"],"related_events":[{"event":"wuzhu-e-o108a","type":"related","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o108a-q","mingdi-e-o039b-q"]}],"order":860}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0002","name":"诸葛瑾","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"mingdi-p0037","name":"孙韶","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"sun-quan","name":"孙权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0115","name":"陆逊","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhouyu-p0035","name":"张承（吴濡须督）","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o039b-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-5bf6d1ed2ab463eadb39","layer":"original","quote":"五月，太白昼现。孙权入居巢湖口〖1〗，向合肥新城〖2〗；又遣将陆议、孙韶各将万余人入淮、沔〖3〗。六月，征东将军满宠进军拒之〖4〗。宠欲拔新城守〖5〗，致贼寿春〖6〗。帝不听，曰：“昔汉光武遣兵悬据略阳〖7〗，终以破隗嚣〖8〗。先帝东置合肥，南守襄阳，西固祁山〖9〗；贼来辄破于三城之下者〖10〗，地有所必争也。纵权攻新城，必不能拔；敕诸将坚守，吾将自往征之；比至，恐权走也。”","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":268,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":189,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o108a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-8d6d7b03ef7e78c66434","layer":"original","quote":"夏五月，权遣陆逊、诸葛瑾等屯江夏、沔口〖5〗；孙韶、张承等向广陵、淮（阳）〔阴〕〖6〗；权率大众，围合肥新城。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":47,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o107","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-adeefad7184b459985c1","layer":"original","quote":"三年春正月〖1〗，诏曰：“兵久不辍，民困于役，岁或不登〖2〗。其宽诸逋〖3〗，勿复督课〖4〗。”","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_001.xhtml","index":46,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":48,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-b-934abed655148ea08df3","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-934abed655148ea08df3","layer":"modern","quote":"〖2〗十二年：建兴十二年（公元 234）。以上诸葛亮出兵北伐共计五次，经由祁山只有两次。后世所说的“六出祁山”并非历史真实。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":269,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-1e22705f935572994567","start":0,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-o039","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-e60db7c722cd4fe4fb69","layer":"original","quote":"十二年春〖2〗，亮悉大众由斜谷出，以流马运；据武功五丈原〖3〗，与司马宣王对于渭南〖4〗。亮每患粮不继，使己志不申；是以分兵屯田，为久驻之基。耕者杂于渭滨居民之间，而百姓安堵〖5〗，军无私焉〖6〗。﹝三﹞相持百余日。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":258,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":108,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
